/cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225209641930752485712.png/hOY_uA5N8rEWYSrCtUaOBuK44eowiTfQ1xznH9cc5x8\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><p>才切割文策院　林志玲陸劇「被消失」</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-26T13:20:02.810719+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1320,"images":33,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}